  "created": "2026-09-19T20:44:07.95Z",
  "description": "Three Content-section dashboards for Umbraco 18 that show a team of editors who owns which pages. My Content lists everything you own with its publish status and how long since it was touched, Scheduled lists your pending publish and unpublish dates, and an administrators-only Ownership tab hands over everything a departing editor owned in one click. Ownership is Umbraco's built-in creator field, so transfers show up in the standard UI - and they deliberately avoid stamping UpdateDate, so a transfer never makes a page look freshly edited.",
